  "title": "First Merchants Corporation Announces Cash Dividend",
  "summary": "MUNCIE, Ind, Feb. 10, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- First Merchants Corporation declared a cash dividend on February 9, 2026 of $0.36 per common share. The dividend is payable on March 20, 2026 to common shareholders of record as of March 6, 2026. About First Merchants Corporation: First Merchants",
